        <section id="seeking-feedback"  class="t-bg-primary">
          
    <div class="l-media ">
        
        <h2 class="l-media__title">
          Seeking feedback
        </h2>

      <div class="l-media__body ">
        <p>Feedback is a part of how we work and is an important part of communication. It can be a simple comment or a detailed and structured discussion on how and what we communicate to each other. Feedback may seem a little intimidating at first as it may involve criticism, but it can also help to develop skills and offer opportunities to learn from others. Especially when it is presented in a positive and supporting manner.</p>

      </div>
          <img class="l-media__img" src="~/images/svg/uc/uc_u5_s2_p1_image.svg" alt="" width="300" height="300" >  
    </div>
        </section>
        
    
     
    
  
     
    
  
  
